# scripts/gcc_compare.py's parser and join on canned GCC 13 output
# (Inputs/gcc/remarks.txt) and a canned agreement CSV. Cases: a loop GCC
# vectorizes (line 11); a missed loop whose reason is at a statement line
# (20 -> 21:9); a reason mapped to reduction (30); a reason not in the table
# (40: category "other", text kept); a loop seen both missed and vectorized
# (60: vectorized wins, as GCC re-analyses after versioning); a loop GCC
# never mentions (80: none); an LLVM-only row (90: dropped, not matched by
# LoopLens); two loops on one line, different columns (95: ambiguous); one
# loop inlined into a second function (100: same line and column, both rows
# get GCC's verdict; the statement text after the reason is dropped).
# Outer-loop and basic-block lines are ignored.
# RUN: %python %S/../../scripts/gcc_compare.py --agreement %S/Inputs/gcc/agreement.csv \
# RUN:   --gcc-output %S/Inputs/gcc/remarks.txt --suite t --out %t.csv --summary %t.sum.csv \
# RUN:   | FileCheck --check-prefix=STDOUT %s
# RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.csv
# RUN: FileCheck --check-prefix=SUM %s < %t.sum.csv
# CHECK:      suite,file,line,function,looplens_primary,looplens_rule,llvm,gcc,gcc_reason,gcc_category,same_category
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,11,main,none,none,vectorized,vectorized,,none,yes
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,20,main,stride,cost-strided,missed,missed,complicated access pattern,stride,yes
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,30,main,reduction,red-exact-fp,missed,missed,unsupported use in stmt,reduction,yes
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,40,main,loop-carried-dependence,mem-unsafe-dep,missed,missed,some reason GCC 14 might add,other,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,60,main,call-or-unsafe-memop,call-no-vector-form,missed,vectorized,,none,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,80,main,loop-carried-dependence,mem-unsafe-dep,missed,none,,,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,95,main,loop-carried-dependence,mem-unsafe-dep,missed,ambiguous,,,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,95,main,none,none,vectorized,ambiguous,,,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,100,kern,reduction,red-exact-fp,missed,missed,no vectype for stmt,other,no
# CHECK-NEXT: t,k/a.c,100,main,reduction,red-exact-fp,missed,missed,no vectype for stmt,other,no
# CHECK-NOT:  ,90,
# SUM:      suite,group,loops,gcc_vectorized,gcc_missed_same_category,gcc_missed_other_category,gcc_no_verdict
# SUM-NEXT: t,all,10,2,2,3,3
# SUM-NEXT: t,llvm-vectorized,2,1,0,0,1
# SUM-NEXT: t,llvm-missed,8,1,2,3,2
# SUM-NEXT: t,looplens:call-or-unsafe-memop,1,1,0,0,0
# SUM-NEXT: t,looplens:loop-carried-dependence,3,0,0,1,2
# SUM-NEXT: t,looplens:reduction,3,0,1,2,0
# SUM-NEXT: t,looplens:stride,1,0,1,0,0
# STDOUT: t: 10 loops; LLVM missed 8, of which GCC vectorizes 1; both missed with the same category: 2 of 5 with a GCC reason
